NOTE ON DATA AND MODELS

This licence covers the code, the notebooks, the documentation and the
synthetic data generated by this repository.

It does NOT cover:

  * Third-party datasets downloaded by scripts/download_data.py. Open Power
    System Data's time series carries the terms of its publisher and requires
    attribution; see data/README.md.
  * Pretrained models downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face Hub. As
    configured the course uses only Apache-2.0 models, but check the model card
    before substituting another one — "open weights" is not the same as
    "open source".
  * Networks shipped with pandapower, which carry pandapower's own licence.
